id: zoom-field-kept
section: Keyboard and fields
item: T-643: a field low on a page fit-zoomed below 1, tapped: the keyboard comes up, the field is moved above it, and the zoom stays where it was (no zoom onto the field)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-dtap.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R5
wait rect 'sel:#f' 30
calibrate 'sel:h1'
expect zoom-max 0.8
tap 'sel:#f'
expect keyboard up 8
wait settled 6
# above the keyboard's top (T-643's criterion), not within fl_bring's 600-row reach for taps
expect above-keyboard 'sel:#f'
expect zoom-max 0.8
